      <description><![CDATA[<h2>Version 1.0.3</h2><h3>Fixed</h3><ul><li><strong>Context menu on external volumes</strong>: the Finder menu did not appear inside volumes that macOS reports as hidden, such as some external disks, because the extension never watched them. It now watches everything mounted under <code>/Volumes</code>.</li></ul>]]></description>
